trap-identity.mdx","Identidad inicial y autenticación","Prepara confianza del servidor y pruebas de admisión para enroll y reenroll.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity",{"_52":248},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/bootstrap-identity.mdx",{"_26":250,"_33":45,"_28":251,"_39":252,"_48":-7,"_11":253,"_50":254},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx","Integra el cliente EST","Prepara la confianza, envía una CSR y comprueba la identidad recibida.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client",{"_52":255},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-client.mdx",{"_26":257,"_33":45,"_28":258,"_39":259,"_48":-7,"_11":260,"_50":261},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx","Renovación y recuperación","Renueva sin perder la identidad y recupera dispositivos según su estado real.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery",{"_52":262},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/renewal-and-recovery.mdx",{"_26":264,"_33":45,"_28":265,"_39":266,"_48":-7,"_11":267,"_50":268},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx","Distribución y actualización de confianza","Separa raíces, intermedias y confianza TLS inicial al distribuir o migrar certificados.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution",{"_52":269},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/trust-distribution.mdx",{"_26":271,"_33":45,"_28":272,"_39":273,"_48":-7,"_11":274,"_50":275},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx","Referencia EST","Consulta las rutas, formatos, autenticación y respuesta multipart de Lamassu.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference",{"_52":276},"platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/est-reference.mdx",{"_26":278,"_33":45,"_28":279,"_39":280,"_48":-7,"_11":281,"_50":282},"es:platform/iot-fleets/enrollment/troubleshooting.mdx","Diagnóstico de enrolamiento","Localiza fallos de transporte, autenticación, registro, emi