ernetes.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/deployment/self-hosted/helm",{"_52":376},"deployment/self-hosted/helm.mdx",{"_26":378,"_33":45,"_28":379,"_39":380,"_48":-7,"_11":381,"_50":382},"es:deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx","Expón el Gateway","Elige cómo llegan los clientes a Lamassu, cuándo definir gateway.addresses y cómo diseñar varios Gateways.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/deployment/self-hosted/networking",{"_52":383},"deployment/self-hosted/networking.mdx",{"_26":385,"_33":45,"_28":386,"_39":387,"_48":-7,"_11":388,"_50":389},"es:deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx","Fastlane","Arranca un entorno completo de evaluación o laboratorio de Lamassu en un clúster Kubernetes existente.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/deployment/self-hosted/fastlane",{"_52":390},"deployment/self-hosted/fastlane.mdx",{"_26":392,"_33":73,"_48":-7,"_28":393},"es:_8","Operación",{"_26":395,"_33":45,"_28":396,"_39":397,"_48":-7,"_11":398,"_50":399},"es:deployment/troubleshooting.mdx","Resolución de problemas de despliegue","Diagnostica acceso, salud de los servicios y dependencias de infraestructura.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/deployment/troubleshooting",{"_52":400},"deployment/troubleshooting.mdx",{"_26":402,"_33":73,"_48":-7,"_28":403},"es:_9","Otros modelos",{"_26":405,"_33":45,"_28":406,"_39":407,"_48":-7,"_11":408,"_50":409},"es:deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx","Despliega desde AWS Marketplace","Ejecuta una instancia preconfigurada de Lamassu IoT en Amazon EC2.","/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/es/deployment/aws-marketplace",{"_52":410},"deployment/aws-marketplace.mdx",{"_26":412,"_33":45,"_28":413,"_39":414,"_48":-7,"_11":12,"_50":415},"es:deployment/saas.mdx","Utiliza Lamassu como SaaS","Consume Lamassu como servicio gestionado sin operar infraestructura propia.",{"_52":416},"deployment/saas.mdx","es:deployment",{"_187":419},"deployment/meta.json","<link rel=\"preload\" as=\"image\" href=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/images/kubernetes.svg\"/><img src=\"/docs/pr-preview/pr-27/images/kubernetes.svg\" wi